{"id":"3edeb874814e8c15","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-syntactic-incompleteness.md","title":"Syntactic Incompleteness","display":"df-syntactic-incompleteness — Syntactic Incompleteness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-syntactic-incompleteness","aliases":["90-df-syntactic-incompleteness"],"display":"df-syntactic-incompleteness — Syntactic Incompleteness","depends_on":["[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-syntactic-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-syntactic-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-syntactic-incompleteness — Syntactic Incompleteness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 为句子公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\sigma\">\\(T\\vdash\\sigma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 中与当前签名匹配的固定有限演算。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (formal signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-theory)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SyntInc}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SyntInc}_S\\)</span> (syntactic-incompleteness predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}syntactic\\text{-}incompleteness}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{SyntInc}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\bigl(T\\nvdash\\sigma\\land T\\nvdash\\neg\\sigma\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}syntactic\\text{-}incompleteness}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{SyntInc}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\bigl(T\\nvdash\\sigma\\land T\\nvdash\\neg\\sigma\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>语法不完备性是指存在句子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>，使得理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>既不证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>也不证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\sigma\">\\(\\neg\\sigma\\)</span></li>\n<li>这是哥德尔第一不完备性定理的核心结果</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>语法完备与语义完备的区别</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>语法完备：对任意句子，要么证明要么反驳</li>\n<li>演绎系统相对于语义完备：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\varphi\">\\(\\Gamma,\\varphi\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models\\varphi\">\\(\\Gamma\\models\\varphi\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>一阶谓词逻辑的演绎系统具有上述语义完备性，但某些一阶理论作为句子集仍然语法不完备</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>例子</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>哥德尔句子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G \\leftrightarrow \\neg\\mathrm{Prov}(\\ulcorner G \\urcorner)\">\\(G \\leftrightarrow \\neg\\mathrm{Prov}(\\ulcorner G \\urcorner)\\)</span>\n对标准 Gödel 句，一致性足以推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\nvdash G\">\\(T\\nvdash G\\)</span>；排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\neg G\">\\(T\\vdash\\neg G\\)</span> 还需 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>-一致性、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性或适当可靠性条件</li>\n<li>Rosser 句改进 Gödel 论证：只需一致性，而不需 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性。</li>\n<li>若 PA、ZFC 一致，则它们因可有效公理化且足够强而语法不完备。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>性质</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>满足 Rosser 论证有效性条件的一致、可有效公理化算术理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\implies\">\\(\\implies\\)</span> 语法不完备</li>\n<li>不完备句子可以在标准模型中真或假</li>\n<li>对本质不可判定的基理论（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>），不完备性不能由一致且可有效公理化的扩张消除；任意一致一阶理论仍可有不要求有效公理化的完备一致扩张。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>相关概念</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b2b5974a0bdc4e1b\" href=\"?note=b2b5974a0bdc4e1b\" title=\"90-df-godel-sentence\">90-df-godel-sentence</a> — 导致不完备的句子</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7c51b51998a67f02\" href=\"?note=7c51b51998a67f02\" title=\"90-df-rosser-sentence\">90-df-rosser-sentence</a> — 改进的不完备性论证</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e3ae8bc1f7b51728\" href=\"?note=e3ae8bc1f7b51728\" title=\"90-df-essentially-undecidable\">90-df-essentially-undecidable</a> — 本质不完备性</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d79ded08ce925b1e\" href=\"?note=d79ded08ce925b1e\" title=\"90-df-incompletable-theory\">90-df-incompletable-theory</a> — 不完备的理论</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 为句子公理集，$T\\vdash\\sigma$ 取 [[90-df-predicate-logic]] 中与当前签名匹配的固定有限演算。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ (sentence set, see [[90-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b2b5974a0bdc4e1b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-sentence]] — 导致不完备的句子","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-rosser-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"7c51b51998a67f02","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[90-df-rosser-sentence]] — 改进的不完备性论证","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-essentially-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"e3ae8bc1f7b51728","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[90-df-essentially-undecidable]] — 本质不完备性","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-incompletable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"d79ded08ce925b1e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[90-df-incompletable-theory]] — 不完备的理论","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"S","display"